      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, you came all this way to hear the rest of our\r\nlast talk... You're quite the enthusiast. Since\r\nyou're here, shall we speak on-site again?",
        "Jp" : "ああ、この前の話の続きを聞きに\r\nわざわざ来てくれたのか\r\n君も物好きだな――\r\nせっかくだ、今回も現地で話そうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790270,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "A secret door leading to Lookout Castle.\r\nLet us make for the Royal Family's Secret\r\nPath, where it lies.\r\n'Tis some distance off, so I shall ready\r\nmyself afore following.\r\nWill you go on ahead?",
        "Jp" : "展望城に通じる秘密の扉\r\nあれがある《王家の隠れ道》に行こう\r\n少々遠いから、支度をしてから向かうよ\r\n先に行っていてくれるかい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790271,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30958,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let us meet at the Royal Family's Secret Path.\r\n'Tis a fair way off, so I'll\r\nmake ready and follow.\r\nWould you go on ahead?",
        "Jp" : "《王家の隠れ道》で待ち合わせよう\r\n少々遠いから、支度をしてから向かうよ\r\n先に行っていてくれるかい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790272,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30959,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Then let us be off. As I said, the secret door\r\nawaits. No telling when another troublesome foe\r\nmay emerge. Two we may be, but let us\r\nnot lower our guard.",
        "Jp" : "では出発といこうか\r\n先ほど言った通り、目的地は秘密の扉だ\r\nいつまた厄介な敵が出てくるとも限らない\r\n二人とはいえ、気を抜かずに行こう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790273,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30960,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "...",
        "Jp" : "――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790274,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In truth, I've precious few good memories\r\nof this place.",
        "Jp" : "実は、ここにはあまり良い思い出が無くてね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790275,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Queen Cress— no, the new Lord Fire Dragon...\r\nspent her days in quiet seclusion deep within the\r\nDetached Palace and at Lookout Castle, for the\r\nstability of the Dragon Force.",
        "Jp" : "クレス様――いや、新たな火竜様は\r\n竜力の安定のため、離宮の奥深くや展望城で\r\n静かに過ごしていらっしゃった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 796707,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Twas all peaceful... tranquil days, each one.\r\nThen, of a sudden, the sky warped—and an ebon\r\nwyrm appeared— Lord Fire Dragon, naturally,\r\nsallied forth to battle at once.",
        "Jp" : "何もかもが平穏で、のどかな毎日だった\r\nそこへ、突然空の歪みと共に黒き竜が現れ――\r\n火竜様ももちろんすぐに戦いに出られた"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 796708,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "",
        "Jp" : "たとえ力及ばずとも、私も\r\nクレス様のお傍で戦いたかった\r\nしかし同時に、彼女自身がそれを望んでいないことも\r\nわかっていたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 796709,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Her wish... to guide the people to a haven\r\nbeyond the battle's reach—",
        "Jp" : "その望みは、激戦の影響の及ばぬ安全な場に\r\n民を誘導すること――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 796710,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I chose to guide the folk to safety.\r\nDriving back the orcs, I sought to spirit them\r\naway through the Royal Family's Secret Path.",
        "Jp" : "私は民を誘導することを選んだ\r\nオークを蹴散らし、この《王家の隠れ道》から\r\n彼らを逃がそうとした"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 796711,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Mind you, the Demon Army fell upon multiple towns\r\nat once, so in hindsight... there was naught such\r\nas a \"safe place\"...",
        "Jp" : "最も、魔軍は同時にいくつもの町を\r\n襲っていたから、今となって思えば\r\n\"安全な場所\"なんてなかったんだけどね――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 796712,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To me, this place is... much like a labyrinth I\r\nran blindly through, amidst confusion and regret.",
        "Jp" : "私にとって、ここは――\r\n混乱と後悔の中でひた走った迷宮みたいなものだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 796713,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4513,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Kirsty",
      "Jp" : "キルスティ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30961,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
