  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 30962,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I am Queen Cress's High Scepter.\r\nOne who moves by her will,\r\ne'en without command.\r\n— A being dedicated to the Queen.",
        "Jp" : "私はクレス様のハイセプターだ\r\n指示を受けずとも己の意思によって\r\n動くことのできる存在\r\n――王のための存在"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 790277,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Had I fought alongside her, Queen Cress's body\r\nand power... might ne'er have been used as the\r\nEvil Dragon's... \"raw materials\".",
        "Jp" : "もしも私が共に戦っていれば\r\nクレス様の肉体と力を\r\n悪しき竜の――\"素材\"としてなんかに――\r\n使われることだけは無かったかもしれない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797216,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "For instance, the instant Queen Cress fell— had I\r\nresorted to forbidden arts, blown away a piece of\r\nher form along with this body of mine...",
        "Jp" : "例えば、クレス様が敗れた瞬間\r\n禁術を用いてでも――この身もろ共\r\nそのお体の一部を吹き飛ばしてしまっていれば――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797217,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "E'en now, I dream of that time...\r\nFighting at Queen Cress's side...\r\nAnd moving in accordance with Her will...",
        "Jp" : "今でも、あの時のことを夢に見る\r\nクレス様のお傍で共に戦うことと\r\nクレス様のご意思を汲んで動くこと――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797218,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Were you in my stead... which would you choose?",
        "Jp" : "もし君が私なら、どちらを選んだ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 797219,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
